      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Unmodified TC4 has relatively low hardness and poor friction and wear properties.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plasma nitriding improves the surface hardness and wear resistance of TC4.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plasma nitriding can improve TC4's surface properties while maintaining its beneficial bulk properties.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plasma nitriding below the β-transus for an optimized duration will form a thin nitrided surface layer.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Careful control of treatment temperature and time can form a hard nitrided layer without altering the underlying bulk microstructure.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plasma nitriding forms titanium nitride phases such as TiN and Ti2N on the TC4 surface.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "During plasma nitriding, nitrogen diffuses into the TC4 surface and reacts with titanium to form hard nitride compounds.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting nitride phases increase surface hardness and wear resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limiting thermal exposure preserves the ductility and corrosion resistance of the alloy interior.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nitrided TC4 will exhibit a statistically significant increase in surface hardness relative to untreated TC4.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nitrided TC4 will exhibit a reduced wear rate relative to untreated TC4.",
